# Text files are LF in the index and in every checkout, Windows included
# (eol= overrides a runner's core.autocrlf=true). CRLF breaks LF-only tooling:
# bash rejects a CRLF dev.sh, and Vite's SSR transform mis-parses a CRLF hashbang.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert or text-diff binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
